     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hello all, I\r\nwant to use a ”true” model <span> </span>covariance\r\nmatrix in a simulation study . In the true model<span>  </span>one X-variable is assumed to have no\r\nrelations with other variables.<span>  </span>So I\r\ntook the fitted covariance matrix from a “preliminary true” model<span>  </span>as input in a LISREL<span>  </span>run and as expected I got a perfect fit and\r\nthe same fitted covariance matrix as the input matrix. However for the same\r\nmodel in lavaan the results are different - different estimates and a different\r\nfitted covariance matrix. I have checked the parameter specifications using the\r\ninspect function and they seem to be identical noting that the beta and gamma\r\nmatrices are “joined” to a beta matrix, and phi and psi matrices<span>  </span>to a psi matrix. I suppose there is something\r\nwrong with my lavaan specification<span>  </span>-\r\ncould you please tell me how to do? Below is the code. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thanks in\r\nadvance, Gunnar <br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">LISREL code</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">TITLE RUN2 USING IMPLIED COV MATRIX FROM RUN1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>DA ni=6 no=200</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>la</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>PB FB A SN PBC I</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>cm</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>4.840</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>1.786<span>      </span>2.028</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>1.474<span>      </span>0.933<span>     \r\n</span>1.796</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>0.152<span>      </span>0.101<span>     \r\n</span>0.378<span>      </span>1.988</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>2.244<span>      </span>1.380<span>     \r\n</span>0.911<span>      </span>0.000<span>      </span>2.890</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>2.455<span>      </span>1.510<span>     \r\n</span>1.246<span>      </span>0.000<span>      </span>2.213<span>     \r\n</span>3.460</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>mo NY=2 nx=4 be=sd ps=di</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">FI GA(1,2) GA(2,2)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><span> </span>Path diagram</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><span> </span>ou SE TV MI RS</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Lavaan code</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">lower &lt;-\r\n&#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">4.840</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">1.786<span>      </span>2.028</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">1.474<span>      </span>0.933<span>      </span>1.796</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">0.152<span>      </span>0.101<span>      </span>0.378<span>     \r\n</span>1.988</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">2.244<span>      </span>1.380<span>      </span>0.911<span>     \r\n</span>0.000<span>      </span>2.890</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">2.455<span>      </span>1.510<span>      </span>1.246<span>     \r\n</span>0.000<span>      </span>2.213<span>      </span>3.460</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&#39;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">m1t.cov\r\n&lt;- </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>    </span>getCov(lower, names = c(&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">PB</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&quot;,&quot;FB&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">A</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">SN</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">PBC</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">I</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&quot;))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">model &lt;-&#39;<span>  </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">PB~A+PBC+I</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">FB~PB+A+PBC+I</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">A~~SN+PBC+I</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">SN~~PBC+I</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">PBC~~I</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">m1tfit &lt;-\r\nsem(model, sample.cov=m1t.cov, sample.nobs=200, fixed.x=FALSE)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">summary(m1tfit,</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> standardized\r\n= TRUE</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>"
